window.products.push({"id":685018,"name":"Andency Dark Gray Tufted Duvet Cover King Size (104x90 Inch), 3 Pieces Boho Soft Microfiber Bedding for All Seasons, Shabby Chic Embroidery Geometric ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KmTMv4wxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Tufted Design]: Andency dark grey duvet cover adopts a classic and cute tufted design, bringing a shabby chic experience. The geometrically arranged appearance also adds luxury to the bedroom. A side is an advanced tufted pattern, stylish and beautiful, But the inside is made of silky soft fabric to help you sleep peacefully. [ What You Can Receive ] King size duvet cover includes 1 tufted duvet cover (104*90 Inches) and 2 pillowcases (20*36 Inches) without comforter and pillow insert. Please allow 0.03-0.09 inch error due to manual measurement. The king duvet cover set has two envelope pillowcases, easy to wash or replace. Simple style farmhouse bedding set gift idea for teens, boys, girls, men, or women. [ Superb Fabric ] Andency tufted duvet cover set is made from high-quality microfiber, offers superior breathability and softness, keep you comfortable all through the night. It is more durable than other materials to keep you cool in the summer and dry and warm in the winter. [ Hidden Zipper & Corner Ties ] We use hidden side zippers, which will not affect the appearance of the duvet cover and is easy to disassemble and washable for you. At the same time, the boho duvet cover sets have 8 strong ties on each corner of the duvet cover to ensure that your comforter inside remains in place underneath the cover. [ Easy Care ] Machine washes cold, gentle cycle, and simply sun-dry or tumble dry on a low setting. Iron on low heat. Do not bleach. You will find the bedding set even softer with each wash. Essential note the pattern of the pillowcases is random, the picture is for reference only. Please subject to our actual products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KmTMv4wxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andency","source_asin":"B097XQ3T36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097XQ3T36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097XQ3T36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
