window.products.push({"id":685021,"name":"Corner Shower Caddy Suction Cup, Reusable Plastic Shower Caddy Holds up to 22LB, Shower Corner Shelf for Shampoo Conditioner, Wall Mount Shower Organi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6196ylCybRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER HEAVY DUTY SUCTION CUP - The suction cup of the corner shower shelf adopts the design principle of \"octopus\" sucker, and is made of New TPE materials, maximum load up to 22LB, enough to bear the weight of daily toiletries. Sector-shape corner shower caddy is big enough for organizing essentials like shampoos, shower gels, conditioner, mouthwash, etc. EASY TO INSTALL - NO drills, No tools, No damage to your wall. This suction cup shower caddy can be successfully installed by pressing the suction cup hard onto the wall until you hear a “click”. (Note: the wall should be dry and clean before you install the shower corner caddy). In addition, there are 3 buckles on the back of plastic shower caddy for adjusting position that perfectly fit various wall corners. QUICK DRY & Multiple HOOKS DESIGN: Made of high-quality ABS and TPE materials, our shower corner shelf will stick firmly on wall even in humid environment and won’t get rusty. Also, the hollow bottom design of corner shower rack make things like shampoo, shower gel, conditioner and facial cleaner drains water quickly. Fence hook design at the front of the shower basket, convenient to hang small items such as brush, bath ball and towel etc.. REMOVABLE & REUSABLE: This suction cup shower caddy can be easily removed with the card included in the package and won’t leave any sticky residue on the wall. It also can be easily reinstalled on the wall. Our corner shower caddy can be widely used in your bathroom, kitchen bedroom, and living room to organize Toiletries and kitchen condiments like shampoos, shower gels, conditioner, olive oil, and vinegar etc. Use Widely: This corner bathroom shelf works very well on metal, ceramic tile, varnished wood, smooth laminat, marble surface, and other smooth solid surfaces. Don’t use it on porous, bumpy and rough surfaces such as gypsum wall, painted wall, concrete wall, wall paper etc.. Our suction shower caddy can help you save space and make your house more beautiful and tidier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6196ylCybRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Budget & Good","source_asin":"B0B9XQC1CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XQC1CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XQC1CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
