window.products.push({"id":685049,"name":"SIDIZ T50 Adjustable Ergonomic Office Desk Chair : Advanced Mechanism for Customization/Extreme Comfort, Ventilated Mesh Back, Lumbar Support, 3-Way A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y-bJuqVSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIVE FREEDOM TO YOUR BODY : T50 is not only beautiful, but also practical in the ergonomic point of view. It ideally supports your back, helping you stay comfortable all day long. With T50 moving naturally with you, you‘ll be supported in every single position. ​Experience SIDIZ’s advanced ergonomic technology with T50. Key Product Features ERGONOMIC S-CURVE DESIGN: The beautifully-shaped backrest makes your waist remain in an S-shape and prevents back pain while weight on the lumber disk is distributed properly. EASILY CUSTOMIZABLE : With the advanced multi-limited tilting mechanism, you may set the chair to 5 different tilting angles, and lean to the degree you wish. You can also change the seat slope or slide, and adjust the armrest and the headrest as you wish. These allow you to personalize the chair to your preference. FRESH MESH BACK : High quality polyester stripe mesh back provides a comfortable seating experience with good ventilation for long term use. STRONG AND FLEXIBLE STRUCTURE : T50 consists of an aluminum frame to ensure high durability. The parts that touch the body are made of more soft and comfortable materials for your comfort. The seat pad allows you to have a more padded pillowy sitting experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y-bJuqVSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIDIZ","source_asin":"B07HF49N4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HF49N4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HF49N4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
