window.products.push({"id":685058,"name":"U-Taste Perforated Baguette Pan 15 x 13 Inches for Baking, Nonstick 446℉ Heat Resistance Carbon Steel French Bread Baking Pan with 4 Loaf, Oven Toaste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816jlUqW+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it.] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [Non-Stick BPA Free Carbon Steel] You will get 4 stunning baguettes every time by using this baguette pan. Nothing is going to stuck on it, and the baguettes just slide right off without any hassle. It’s coated with anti-sticky food grade material, you can safely use them to make baguettes and no worries about the bottom of your breads turning into shiny silver as some cheap pans may do to you. It’s versatile for your gluten-free baguettes, French bread, sourdough bread, cheese baguette, etc. [446℉ Heat Resistant and Even Heating] Has it ever occurred to you that your baguettes turn out with some burned crusts and some far from crispy? We picked the 446℉ heat resistant carbon steel, since it has to go in to the oven, but more for its efficient heat conductivity. A nice french bread baking pan should conduct heat quickly and evenly to make sure every time you push 4 doughs into the oven, you will get 4 perfectly brown baguettes after. A nice kitchen supplies for your daily baking. [Perforation for Air Circulation] The gist to make a nice and crunchy baguette is to have enough holes on the french bread pan to let air circulate freely and more moisture onto bread for an even bake and nice crust. U-Taste baguette pan for baking is perforated to allow even browning without over cooking. These little holes on the baguette tray make a wonderful crusty finish to the bread, and let the loaves come right off even without an oil spray and easy to clean after. [Protected Safe Rounded Edges] If the corners are too pointy, it’s not a kitchen tool but rather a potential threat to anyone that cooks. It may pierce our nice clothes, or worse, our hands. And therefore, we polished the edges, and turned the sharp corners into 4 rounded ones. You can hold it, touch it, and bake with it without a second thought. This baguette baking pan is dishwasher safe and hand-washing. It also comes with a hanging hole for easy hanging storage and saving your counter space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816jlUqW+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B09DG42GLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DG42GLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DG42GLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
