window.products.push({"id":685219,"name":"Lann's Linens 60\" x 126\" Rose Gold Sequin Tablecloth, Sparkly Rectangle Table Cloth for Wedding, Party, Banquet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jhIQ07S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring timeless elegance and extra sparkle to any event with this sequin tablecloth from Lann’s Linens. Create an eye-catching statement table by updating your decor. This glamorous sequin tablecloth is perfect for decorating wedding cake tables, birthday gift tables, bridal and baby showers, themed parties, and more. Sparkly patterned rows of shiny, glitz sequins have been expertly sewn across a soft, mesh knit fabric backing. The soft mesh fabric is flawlessly colored to match the sequins achieving the desired high-end look. This sequined tablecloth is finished with a beautiful serged hem edge allowing for a dramatic draping effect. This sequin tablecloth from Lann's Linens arrives ready to use, instantly allowing you to add an upscale and glamorous touch to any event. This dazzling tablecloth effortlessly covers any table for a sophisticated effect. Make a long-lasting impression on your guests by coordinating these glittery linens with any party theme. Lann’s Linens luxurious sequin tablecloths and overlays are seamless up to 48\" (4') wide. Larger sizes will have seams. These seams have been expertly sewn, are hardly visible, and will not affect the presentation of these table linens or their beautiful drape. Item is 100% brand new, first-run production. Care Instructions: Spot clean recommended. As needed, hand or machine wash cold delicate with mild soap. Lay flat or line dry only. Do not bleach. Do not iron. Due to the many variations in monitors and browsers, color samples may appear slightly different than the actual product. Well-known within the national hospitality and restaurant industries, private wedding and banquet venues, and the party planning community, Lann's Linens is your trusted source for premium-quality, durable tablecloths that provide 5-star style at an affordable price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jhIQ07S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lann's Linens","source_asin":"B07WPG5B75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WPG5B75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WPG5B75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
