window.products.push({"id":685249,"name":"Haperlare Sheer Window Curtains, Linen Textured Voile Curtain Set Embroidered with Pom Pom Voile Sheers for Bedroom Living Room, 52 x 63 Inch, 2 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oCma+wo3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Premium Polyester Fabric Ready Made: 2 panels per package. Each sheer panel measures 52 inch wide by 63 inch long. 8 metal grommets per panel with 1.6 inch inner diameter fit up to a 1.5\" rod, makes it incredibly easy to hang with a curtain rod. Pom Pom Design:  The curtains offers a trendy pom pom that make the drapes more lovely and casual. Hang these voile sheer drapes in a bedroom or living room to style up and lighten the feel of the room. Four color options of the pompoms will suitable for all of your home fashion. Quality Fabric: The sheer curtains have a linen texture that can seamlessly blend with your decor and update your room. The window panels allow natural light in, open the curtains and you get the full warmth of the sun. Wide Compatiblity: The sheer window treatment drape can be hung separately or paired with other curtains. Voile sheer drapes enable you to appreciate the beautiful scene outside the window freely while sustaining enough privacy. Perfect for living rooms, bedrooms, offices, kids rooms and more, they are guaranteed to add a touch of luxury and finesse to your home! Easy care: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, do not bleach, tumble dry low, light iron as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oCma+wo3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haperlare","source_asin":"B082TTH3LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082TTH3LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082TTH3LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":685250,"name":"Modern Slim Bamboo Cream Kitchen Utensil Holder Caddy - Rust Proof and Dishwasher Safe Kitchen Utensil Holder for Countertop - Kitchen Utensil Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uj+b6IUGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SLIM MEANS TINY! - Stop cramming your utensils into huge metal cups that take up too much counter space, or into a drawer that can barely close. Our slim cooking utensil holder maintains both a small profile and an intriguing modern look allowing you to free up drawer space and stop rummaging for utensils every time you cook. STURDY NO-TIP CONSTRUCTION - Our kitchen utensil organizer WILL NOT TIP OVER! Nothing is more frustrating than having your utensil or spatula holder tip over while you're cooking Stop using a cheap spoon holder that will tip and flip every time you use them. Our utensil holder is the REAL DEAL! PERFECTLY DESIGNED -Our utensil caddy has a unique modern Scandinavian minimalist design with eco-friendly bamboo that will look stunning on your kitchen counter. Our kitchen utensil holder maintains a rubberized gripped bottom so it won’t stain your counter and will stay in one place during use. CLEANING IS A BREEZE - Other metal utensil holders can rust and stain your counters with ugly spots over time, or they can scratch your countertops. Our cutlery holder has rubberized bottom to ensure that it won't harm your counter or slide around, and is completely RUST-PROOF. The whole utensil holder is 100% DISHWASHER SAFE! OUR SLIM UTENSIL HOLDER AND KITCHEN CADDY IS A WONDERFUL ADDITION TO ANY KITCHEN -, Sturdy BAMBOO Construction. Our utensil crock is also Dishwasher Safe. Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uj+b6IUGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooler Kitchen","source_asin":"B08S48LCXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S48LCXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S48LCXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
