window.products.push({"id":685397,"name":"Sugarhouse Silicone Baking Mold | Links Into 50 different Shapes (Mold plus Mat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IpOZdqlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silicone bakeware is the best! Silicone is easy to use, completely non-stick so there is never anything ‘baked-on’ to try to clean off! However to make your cake edges clean, you may want to use coconut oil or spray on the pieces. They are easy to store because they are lightweight and flexible and you never have to worry about them breaking, getting scratched, dented or going rusty. You can clean them in the dishwasher, you can use them in the microwave, refrigerator and freezer. Key advantages of Silicone Bakeware Mold Pieces: Simple to Turn Out or Peel off. No stuck on bottoms to worry about. Silicone pans make it really simple to turn out or unmold your baked goods. Because they are so flexible and completely non-stick, there is no more frustration with some of your beautiful creation getting stuck to the inside of the pan. Silicone Pans cool really quickly when you take them out of the oven, this means that your pan will be cool to touch at the rim so you can unmold cakes and muffins – or whatever you need to do, without risk of burning yourself on a hot pan fairly quickly. You can just pop the pans in the dishwasher (even on the bottom shelf) or wash them by hand in warm soapy water – you can even turn them inside out if you want to! So there are never any tricky corners or crevices to clean whatever shape you choose – and there are lots, hearts, stars and more! It is stain proof so it will not fade or discolor and because is is non-absorbent and scratchproof, you do not have to worry about any bacteria lurking unseen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IpOZdqlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sugar House","source_asin":"B072MFXBT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MFXBT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MFXBT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":685398,"name":"Barn Wood Cutting Board Butcher Block","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Fo7kYXEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These cutting boards are made from reclaimed barn wood in the Shenandoah Valley of Virginia. Each one is made with a variety of different beautiful woods most of which are hard woods. The dark purple with wavy black lines running through it is walnut. The grey close grained wood is white oak, which is very hard. The tan and white wood with close lines going through it is heart pine. The cinnamon colored wood is red elm. The dark green is tulip poplar. The grey with streaks of brown is hickory. The pink and white wood is cedar. The red and brown close grained wood is red oak. The pure white is white Ash, or possibly maple. The light reddish brown is cherry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Fo7kYXEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barn Wood Toys & More","source_asin":"B00FAYMYUA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FAYMYUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FAYMYUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
