window.products.push({"id":685472,"name":"9 inch Bread Knife Off-Set Fully Forged Pro-Series Ergo Chef","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JoBP-cdsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Ergo Chef Pro Series 9-inch serrated bread and multi-function knife is one of a kind and combines Ergo Chef’s proven patented handle design with an offset blade that prevents knuckles from contacting cutting surfaces for smooth, safe cutting. This serrated bread knife was given highest ratings when culinary students and chefs tested against other serrated multipurpose knives. The blade features a precision sharp D-shaped serrated edge that produces perfect slices of bread with both hard & soft crusts without tearing, while minimizing the crumbs. This bread knife can also be used to cut fruit, or carving ham, chicken, and beef without tearing or shredding because of its specially designed serrations. Enjoy this serrated knife as it can be used for many cutting tasks not just bread. Made from German high carbon steel for stain resistance and durability","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JoBP-cdsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergo Chef","source_asin":"B000EDPVZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EDPVZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EDPVZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":685473,"name":"General Robert E. Lee; Custis Lee and aide Walter Taylor, 8 X 10 Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q1y9cUCqL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"General Robert E. Lee; Custis Lee (left) and aide Walter Taylor (right) Two people close to Robert E. Lee during the Civil War were his son Custis (left) and his aide Walter Taylor (right). Custis was named “George Washington Custis Lee” to honor his mother’s side of the family and her relationship to Martha (Custis) Washington. He followed in his father’s footsteps and entered West Point at the age of 17. Walter Taylor had graduated from Virginia Military Institute and had become a Banker prior to the war. He joined the Southern Army in 1861 and was assigned to the staff of Robert E. Lee. The following year, when Lee became commander of the Army of Northern Virginia, Taylor became the assistant adjutant general. Serving as Lee's right hand - he would write dispatches, carry messages for the General and performed reconnaissance operations. At the age of 25, in 1863, he was promoted to Lieutenant Colonel. By this point, he was the gate keeper for Lee and would allow or deny visitors to the General. Taylor was given permission to marry just prior to the end of the war. He was married in Richmond just after midnight on the morning it fell to Federal troops. Evacuating with his wife to Southern lines, he stayed there until after Lee’s surrender. He returned to Richmond, a week after the surrender, on the day this picture was taken. Following the war, Taylor was often called on to resolve disputes about conflicting accounts of the war. He was the first person given access to the National Archives to write his 1877 book, “Four Years with General Lee”. In 1906 he wrote a second book, “Robert E. Lee, His Campaign in Virginia, 1861 to 1865”, which suffered from some of the previous writing style of military statistics. This time, between the statistics, it had been crafted into more of a novel and became a best seller. He died in 1916 at the age of 77.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q1y9cUCqL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B00AF5FLRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AF5FLRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AF5FLRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
