window.products.push({"id":685567,"name":"LOKASS Tactical Lunch bag for Men Work,16L, Insulated Lunch box For Adults/Women Freezable&Thermal, Dual Compartment Reusable Waterproof Leakproof Lun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P6KR6KSwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍇【Lot of Pockets & Larger Capacity】LOKASS Large Lunch Box's Original Dimensions : 11.4\" х 9\" х 8.7\" (L x W x H). Expanded Dimensions：11.4\" х 11.8\" х 8.7\" (L x W x H). Different compartments separate spaces to place different foods. When you needn't the upper space, pull the zipper to fold up the upper compartment. Shoulder strap/ hand-carry- two ways to carry. Adjustable shoulder strap length from 29 inch ~ 53.5 inch. 🍓【Tactical Style & Heavy Duty】This lunchbox for adults is a compact design ideal for work. There is velcro on the front of the bag, it comes with a detachable American flag patch removable to attach your favorite patch. Perfect gift for husband/son/adult men, also a cool choice for women yourselves. 🥝【12 Hours Continuous cooling】The outer of the LOKASS tactical lunch box is made from high density polyester, the inner is a combination of thick foam, PE sheet and a thicker Aluminum liner with EVA coating. This material combines the advantages of both aluminum and EVA, non-toxic and high temperature resistant. We use seamless heat-pressing technology to ensure 100% leak-proof. Take the food from the freezer and place it into the lunch bag with the frozen ice pack, the food will stay fresh for about 12 hours. Preserving food will no longer be a problem for 12-hour shift workers. THIS ITEM IS NOT INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN 12 AND UNDER. 🥑【Come with Ice Pack & Leakproof】The top section of the adult lunch box is expandable for dry stores. The insulation liner and unique stitching ensure the main compartment 100% leak proof. You can put ice cubes with beers into the lunchboxes without worrying water flowing everywhere. In most situations, the resuable ice pack come with the bag is enough keep your lunch fresh for a day. (You need to fill into water and frozen for a night firstly). 🍒【Metal Zipper & Durable】The full lunch bag for men uses an exclusive customed black metal zipper pull for comfort and smoothness. The main compartment uses a seamless waterproof zipper, you needn't to worry about rain entering on rainy days. The zipper won't deform or break down after been tested 10,000 times. The shoulder straps and carry handles are reinforced with multiple stitches for greater durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P6KR6KSwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKASS","source_asin":"B0C1YWWVJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1YWWVJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1YWWVJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
