window.products.push({"id":685752,"name":"Anolon Advanced 3-Piece Pasta Set, 7-Quart Covered Stockpot with Stainless Steel Pasta Insert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G7VZ742FL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Say good-bye to the days where straining pasta was a messy, heavy job. With this pasta set, boil pasta in the pasta insert, which fits into the 7qt. stockpot. When it's done, simply lift the pasta insert out of the stockpot, and strain the water back into the pot! Sure Grip Handles ensure a soft, confident grip every time. ... Amazon.com This versatile three-piece cookware set includes a 7-quart stockpot, a stainless-steel insert, and a glass lid. On its own, the stockpot simmers soups and stews but the steamer insert makes the set additionally useful for pasta, corn on the cob, or other vegetables. Part of Anolon's Advanced line of cookware, the pot is composed of heavyweight hard-anodized aluminum, which heats food evenly with no hot spots. The interior and exterior of the pan are coated with three layers of DuPont's durable Autograph 2 nonstick surface for easy release of foods. Tested by professional chefs, the nonstick coating has proven to stand up to extended use in a restaurant. Oven-safe to 375 degrees F, the SureGrip handles on both the pot and pasta insert are made of durable 18/10 stainless steel and covered in a silicone rubber for a safe and heat-free grip. A shatterproof tempered glass lid lets you watch your food cook without releasing any nutrients by lifting the cover. Anolon Advanced cookware is covered by a lifetime limited warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde What's in the Box 7-quart stockpot, stainless-steel insert, glass lid","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G7VZ742FL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B000069RBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000069RBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000069RBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
