window.products.push({"id":685754,"name":"Thai Lao Sticky Rice Single Serving Bamboo Basket 3.5 inch BY INSPIREPOSSIBLE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ptd6whU-L._AC_.jpg","description":"THAI LAO HANDMADE STICKY RICE CONTAINER, SMALL BAMBOO SERVING BASKETS, NATURAL. Size: Small, Diameter 3.5\" x Height 4.5\" (W 8.9 x H 11.4 cm.) Color: Original Bamboo Color. Origin: Natural Bamboo (Handmade work). How to use: For serving sticky rice for both home use and restaurant. Note: Thai people normally eat sticky rice with Somtum (papaya pok pok, papaya salad) and grilled chicken. Note: The Bamboo Serving Baskets are handmade by Thai family and is a traditional and original handmade product of Thailand and is safe to keep hot food because it's authentic (not a plastic).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ptd6whU-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B00GQ6ZZ4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GQ6ZZ4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GQ6ZZ4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":685755,"name":"BENEAIL 6-Blade Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered Non Electric Fireplace Fan for Wood Burning/Pellet/Gas Quickly Warm Air and Silent (Include Magnetic Therm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hfkBJO93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO POWER REQUIRED- Our fireplace fan is an ecofan wood stove fan, which does not require batteries or electricity. Dual path heats conduction enables TEG (thermoelectric generator) to receive stable heat and extend its service life, saving energy. It is green and environmentally friendly, which can reduce fuel consumption by up to 20%, and accelerate the air temperature in the room by 30%. wood stove fan non electric is applicable to various wood burning stoves,gas, pellet stoves. QUIET DESIGN- The only moving part of the fireplace fan is the blade assembly, the new design of the blade, larger air speed, lower noise (≤25db), It's like the sound of a leaf falling,let you won't notice the existence of the fireplace fan heat powered，so you can enjoy the warm air in a silent environment. HIGH TEMPERATURE WARNING- There is a temperature sensing bar on the top of our heat fan.It has four stages.First stage, and the temperature is about 300℉ - 390℉ to reach the starting temperature.The second stage is about 390°F - 480°F. At this time, the higher the temperature, the faster the heater fan speed.Third stage, the temperature is about 480℉-570℉,and the display is full. Please remove the fan.If it is in the third stage for a long time,high temperature will damage the product. 6 BLADES FOR WIDER HEAT DISTRIBUTION- The newly calibrated and enhanced 6-blade wood burning stove fan has high quality streamlined blades unlike other traditional four-blade wood burning fireplace fans. Our six-blade thermoelectric fan will provide more and greater airflow, giving you over 60% effective air movement in your room. We also include a complimentary wood stove accessory - a thermometer that allows you to monitor the temperature of your fireplace at all times to avoid overheating. SIMPLE AND DURABLE- The woodstove fan is made of anodized aluminum that will not rust or corrode, and will not deform, rust, or change color even after prolonged use at high temperatures. Wear-resistant, good heat conductivity (this non-electric stove fan operates at 158°F-662°F) and small enough for tight spaces, no assembly required, just place the fan on a flat, smooth surface on top of the stove, near the side or back of the fireplace, at least 4 inches from the stove. 100% SATISFIED AFTER-SALES SERVICE- We provide you with the best fireplace fan, and provide reliable customer service. After your purchase, we will provide you with after-sales protection. We can provide 30 days of refund service and up to 6 months of after-sales protection. If you have any questions, you can contact us at any time, and we will make you 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hfkBJO93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BENEAIL","source_asin":"B0BJK2SWVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJK2SWVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJK2SWVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
