window.products.push({"id":685797,"name":"Large Organic Bamboo Cutting Board - Wooden Charcuterie Cheese Serving Platter For Kitchen - With Deep Drip Edge & Garnish Bowls - Boards Are BPA Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c+aff8YeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY BAMBOO AVAILABLE — We source our bamboo exclusively from the Moso species of the bamboo plant. Moso bamboo enjoys its reputation as the hardest and densest bamboo on Earth.   ECO FRIENDLY — Our bamboo boards are made from Organic, BPA Free material and will naturally resist staining.   MAKES A GREAT GIFT for ANYONE in your life who loves to cook!   LOW MAINTENANCE WOOD ALTERNATIVE — The beauty of our bamboo cutting boards is that they resist retaining water and yet they're nearly maintenance free if you live in an environment that isn’t high in humidity. As long as they are not soaked in water or put in a dishwasher (no cutting boards, regardless of wood type should be placed in a dishwasher), they should last for years to come. If your location receives its fair share of humid days, an occasional light coat of food grade mineral oil or bees wax will protect your board from the damaging effects of sustained exposure to moisture.   NO NONSENSE CUSTOMER SERVICE — We are available to you 7 days a week to help. Feel free to contact us day or night with any questions. Satisfied customers are the heart of our business and that’s why we offer a 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE. If you are unhappy with your cutting board, simply return it for a full refund with no questions asked.   SUPERIOR HEALTH AND SANITATION — Even the hardest of maple wood will be scarred by a chefs knife, which will leave pockets for moisture and food particles to accumulate. Bamboo, on the other hand, is often dense enough to resist knife scarring and naturally resists water penetration.   HIGHLY RENEWABLE RESOURCE — A typical bamboo shoot can become fully mature within three to six years (commonly used hardwoods can take as long as thirty).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c+aff8YeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good & Co.","source_asin":"B07L26QP42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L26QP42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L26QP42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
