window.products.push({"id":685916,"name":"OneSpace 100% Recycled Paper Coffee Table, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X+qXYEGfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It looks, feels and performs like traditional furniture. Yet the eco paper coffee table is actually made of 100% recycled paper, the first of its kind. It's part of the OneSpace eco paper furniture line, forged from a unique pressure bonding process that turns real paper into real furniture. Attractive, fully functioning furniture that's durable, lighter weight, and super easy to assemble. So how does OneSpace transform paper into Actual furniture? a pre-measured stack of paper layers is pressure bonded into one solid strength layer, and hard-coated in water-resistant polyurethane laminate. The eco coffee table is a shining example of the amazing end result. Its tabletop and Bottom shelf have a rigidity and density that rivals or exceeds particleboard - even MDF wood. The specially curved, tubular legs possess a firm, supportive wall Thickness that's nothing like paper at all. What's more, each of these components form-fits to its compatible hard plastic connector. Not only is this designed to add stability, it makes assembly a snap - no tools, screws, nails or pegs required; no weak spots because nothing penetrates the material. This innovative, 100% recycled paper coffee table is 100% perfect for any indoor space, especially dorm rooms and apartments. All for a price that fits any size budget. Proudly offered by OneSpace, part of the comfort products family. With a history dating back to 1919, comfort products makes design and innovation affordable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X+qXYEGfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneSpace","source_asin":"B09V8WT4BD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V8WT4BD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V8WT4BD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
