window.products.push({"id":685930,"name":"Hanging Utensil Holder Adhesive Hook - 360 Degrees Rotating Folding Hook - 6 Wall Hangers Without Nails for Kitchen Bathroom Cabinet - No Damage Wall ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S5Ea6sGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you’re short on cabinet space in your kitchen, dressing room, bathroom, or any other area in your house, our 360 ° adhesive hook tool with 6 hooks is the best solution for pots, pans, utensils, scarves, towels, and more. Plus, they also allow you to display some of your finest cookware and linens. If you're looking for a simple design, this heavy-duty adhesive hook tool is perfect for maximizing the little space you have, but still has room to store more than 2 pots and pans. Your wall offers more real estate than you give it credit for! Made of high-quality PP and PVC, this hook is very sturdy and durable, and it comes with 6 hooks that can be utilized with a variety of kitchen and other room designs. It can be easily rotated, folded, and suspended. The utensils hanger is waterproof and oil-proof, resistant to high and low temperatures, and can support a weight of 9 lbs, with extra space for various objects on top of it. Don't worry about falling objects if you hang them with a particular gravity. Its strong adhesive won't allow such thing to happen. The rotating hooks are great for kitchen storage, bathroom storage, bedroom storage, hanging towels, toy accessories, and more. Use it to organize your accessories and jewelry, or in your entryway for hanging your coats, bags, and keys. It's important to keep various spaces and rooms neat and organized. Our holder makes a huge difference in storage space, keeping your space looking great and functioning at optimum efficiency!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S5Ea6sGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09Y6WW29H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-685930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y6WW29H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y6WW29H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
